1\n              </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style='caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                ‍\n               </span>\n</span>\n              大家可以做一下对比\n             </section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n              @@@号外号外，还有可能再附赠+一小包神秘豆哦～具体是啥我就不剧透了\n             </section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n              本期暂停的朋友，好遗憾呀～\n             </section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n                 这期订阅的豆子让我们的也门品相拓展到了第7只\n                 <span style='caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n                  ，每次选豆子都特别期待能选到曾经购买过的品相，不仅仅是一种感情/情感的延续，同时心里也是非常希望能喝到新的批次是否有什么变化，又或者是否还是原来的样子；加上即将上线的这四只，我们在售的5只也门里，你会发现同样是炼金术士的处理方式，但是在风味（香气特征）上有非常明显的不同，而在酸甜感上在触感上好像又都是差不多的饱满，品种上这一次有第一次见到的肯特种；这两个Kent的批次相比Ruwad会有更强的酒感和发酵感，\n                  <span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n                   XI批次特别的葡萄甜酒，精品巧克力，樱桃的感觉，在中温区的单一产区黑巧克力更为突出，到低温时会有一些花香和蜂蜜甜香出现；XV批次就特别的葡萄干，也会有精品巧克力的酸感和可可发酵风味，还会有红色深色莓果的特征，酸感会更强一些酸质也扎实\n                  </span>\n                  ；与另外两只也门妮娅相比的话，刚好是一个风味的渐进，从经典的椰枣干，葡萄干，茶感到开始出现花香，莓果干再到黑巧的可可发酵感的果香和果酸，最后好似终极的复杂多很高的果香，酒感，甚至也有花香都交织在一起，收到豆子后建议一周后再饮用哈～别太心急\n                 </span>\n</section>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Q0sawsrNuEBTlj8u2G09ax1xgH4tnoj8XGcqcB0xq0qpiamG0OGs3xP4S0y0Off9n6e47StF5lXdg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;visibility: visible !important;width: 556.1875px !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style='outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n               关于订阅补充说明：\n              </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;clear: both;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span st